{"title":"Test","puid":"c-mat-6/0qvzgt","path":"/../c-mat-6/topic-08-figuren-und-koerper/block-04-oberflaecheninhalte/level-test","type":"test","minLevelPlayerVersion":"v1.0","voice":"m3","instruction":{"voice":"m3"},"voiceLang":"de","finishButton":true,"keyboardLayout":"numbersComma","lsg":{"width":300},"trainers":[{"trainer":"gapMulti","gapMode":"write","instruction":{"text":"Du siehst das Netz eines Würfels. Berechne seinen Oberflächeninhalt und rechne ihn danach in Quadratmeter um.","speaker":true},"ignoreCase":false,"shuffleAtoms":false,"textAlign":"left","lsg":"/../c-mat-6/topic-08-figuren-und-koerper/block-04-oberflaecheninhalte/lsg/cube-net-02.lsg","hint":"100 dm² = 1 m²","atoms":[{"a":"","b":"<mat>O = 6 * a * a<br>O = 6 * <gap>30</gap> `dm` * <gap>30</gap> `dm` = <gap>5400</gap> `dm`^2 </mat>"},{"a":"","b":"<i>Umrechnung:</i> <mat>O = 5400 `dm`^2  = <gap>54</gap> m^2</mat>"}]},{"trainer":"table","gapMode":"write","instruction":{"text":"Rechne um.","speaker":true},"columnHeader":true,"layout":"a1 b1 c1 d1\na2 b2 c2 d2\na3 b3 c3 d3\na4 b4 c4 d4","hint":"<mat>1 m^2 = 100 `dm`^2 = 10000 `cm`^2 = 1 000 000 `mm`^2</mat>","atoms":[{"id":"a1","b":"<mat>m^2</mat>"},{"id":"b1","b":"<mat>`dm`^2</mat>"},{"id":"c1","b":"<mat>`cm`^2</mat>"},{"id":"d1","b":"<mat>`mm`^2</mat>"},{"id":"a2","b":"0,08"},{"id":"b2","b":"((8))"},{"id":"c2","b":"((800))"},{"id":"d2","b":"((80000))"},{"id":"a3","b":"((0,51))"},{"id":"b3","b":"51"},{"id":"c3","b":"((5100))"},{"id":"d3","b":"((510000))"},{"id":"a4","b":"((0,03))"},{"id":"b4","b":"((3))"},{"id":"c4","b":"300"},{"id":"d4","b":"((30000))"}]},{"trainer":"gapMulti","gapMode":"write","ignoreCase":false,"shuffleAtoms":false,"textAlign":"left","finishButton":false,"gapValidateMode":"value","atoms":[{"a":"Anna möchte einen Holzbalken lackieren. Sie hat genug Lack für eine Fläche von 15 <mat>m^2</mat>. Zuerst misst sie den Balken aus: Länge a = 6 m, Breite b = 0,5 m, Höhe c = 0,5 m.<br><br><b>Frage:</b> Wie groß ist die Oberfläche des Balkens? Reicht die Menge an Lack aus?","b":" <b>Rechnung:</b><br><mat> O = 2 * (a * b + a * c + b * c)<br>O = <gap>2</gap> * ( <gap>6</gap> m * <gap>0.5</gap> m + <gap>6</gap> m * <gap>0.5</gap> m + <gap>0.5</gap> m * <gap>0.5</gap> m)</mat>"},{"a":"","b":"<mat>O = 2 * (3 m^2 + <gap>3</gap> m^2 + <gap>0.25</gap> m^2) = <gap>12.5</gap> m^2</mat>"},{"a":"","b":"<b>Antwort:</b> Der Balken hat eine Oberfläche von ((++12,5 17,5))<mat>m^2</mat>. Die Menge an Lack ist ((zu_gering ++ausreichend)) für die Oberfläche des Balkens.","gapMode":"buttons"}]}],"parentTopic":{"title":"Figuren und Körper","path":"/../c-mat-6/topic-08-figuren-und-koerper/topic","puid":"c-mat-6/dso7k9"},"parentBlock":{"title":"Oberflächeninhalt","path":"/../c-mat-6/topic-08-figuren-und-koerper/block-04-oberflaecheninhalte/block","puid":"c-mat-6/oetapa"},"mediaFiles":{"sounds":[{"fileId":"sound/de/m3/Du siehst das Netz eines Würfels. Berechne seinen Oberflächeninhalt und rechne ihn danach in Quadratmeter um.","etag":"24a8-32405"},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3/Rechne um.","etag":"665d-4058"}],"svgs":[],"lsgs":[{"fileId":"lsg/c-mat-6/topic-08-figuren-und-koerper/block-04-oberflaecheninhalte/lsg/cube-net-02.lsg","etag":"23a7-1139"}],"images":[]},"etag":"6ac9-3250"}